#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:5
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant/urban_piper.rst:165
msgid "Point of Sale"
msgstr "Kassa"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:7
msgid ""
"Odoo **Point of Sale** is designed for managing shops and restaurants. It is "
"web-browser-based, allowing it to run on any device, and is built to "
"maintain functionality even during temporary network outages."
msgstr ""
"Odoo **Kassa** is ontworpen voor het beheren van winkels en restaurants. Het "
"is webgebaseerd, waardoor het op elk apparaat kan draaien, en is gebouwd om "
"functioneel te blijven, zelfs tijdens tijdelijke netwerkstoringen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:11
msgid ""
"Beyond traditional :doc:`store <point_of_sale/shop>` and :doc:`restaurant "
"<point_of_sale/restaurant>` settings, Odoo :abbr:`POS (Point of Sale)` also "
"supports a :doc:`self-ordering <point_of_sale/extra/self_order>` feature, "
"enabling customers to place orders and make payments using a dedicated kiosk "
"or their own mobile device."
msgstr ""
"Naast traditionele :doc:`winkel <point_of_sale/shop>`- en :doc:`restaurant "
"<point_of_sale/restaurant>`settings ondersteunt Odoo :abbr:`Kassa (Point of "
"Sale)` ook een :doc:`zelfbedienings <point_of_sale/extra/"
"self_order>`functie, waarmee klanten bestellingen kunnen plaatsen en "
"betalingen kunnen uitvoeren met een speciale kiosk of hun eigen mobiele "
"apparaat."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:18
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:5
msgid "Workflow"
msgstr "Workflow"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:18
msgid "Set up a POS, manage basic settings, and handle daily operations."
msgstr ""
"Stel een kassa in, beheer basisinstellingen en voer dagelijkse activiteiten "
"uit."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:23
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:5
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant/urban_piper.rst:205
msgid "Products"
msgstr "Producten"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:23
msgid "Configure products, categories, combos, and serial number displays."
msgstr ""
"Configureer producten, categorieën, combo's en weergave van serienummers."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:28
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network.rst:5
msgid "Hardware and network"
msgstr "Hardware en netwerk"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:28
msgid "Connect and configure hardware peripherals and network settings."
msgstr ""
"Sluit randapparatuur aan en configureer deze, en configureer "
"netwerkinstellingen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:33
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:5
msgid "Shop features"
msgstr "Winkelfuncties"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:33
msgid ""
"Features specific to retail: manage quotations, \"ship later\" orders, and "
"barcodes."
msgstr ""
"Functies specifiek voor detailhandel: beheer offertes, \"later verzenden\"-"
"bestellingen en streepjescodes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:38
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:5
msgid "Restaurant features"
msgstr "Restaurant kenmerken"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:38
msgid ""
"Features specific to restaurants: manage floors, tables, tips, and online "
"delivery."
msgstr ""
"Functies specifiek voor restaurants: beheer verdiepingen, tafels, fooien en "
"online levering."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:43
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra.rst:5
msgid "Extra features"
msgstr "Extra functies"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:43
msgid ""
"Shared features: manage employees, preparation displays, self-ordering, and "
"loyalty programs."
msgstr ""
"Gedeelde functies: beheer werknemers, bereidingsschermen, zelfbestelling en "
"loyaliteitsprogramma's."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:48
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods.rst:5
msgid "Payment methods"
msgstr "Betaalmethodes"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:48
msgid ""
"Configure cash and card payments, cash machines, customer accounts, QR "
"codes, and payment terminals."
msgstr ""
"Configureer contante en kaartbetalingen, kasapparaten, klantenrekeningen, QR-"
"codes en betaalterminals."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:54
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/reporting.rst:3
msgid "Reporting"
msgstr "Rapportages"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:54
msgid "View and analyze orders and sessions' statistics."
msgstr "Bekijk en analyseer statistieken van bestellingen en sessies."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:60
