msgstr ""
"Voer een beschrijvende :guilabel:`Naam` in (bv. `Hoofdkeuken`, `Bar`, "
"`Afhaalzone`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/preparation.rst:27
msgid ""
"Select the :guilabel:`Point of Sale` that sends orders to this display. "
"Leave the field empty to link it to *all* points of sale."
msgstr ""
"Selecteer de :guilabel:`Kassa` die bestellingen naar dit scherm stuurt. Laat "
"het veld leeg om het te koppelen aan *alle* kassasystemen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/preparation.rst:29
msgid ""
"Specify the POS :ref:`product categories <pos/products/categories>` to be "
"sent to this display. Leave the field empty to allow *all* categories."
msgstr ""
"Geef de Kassa :ref:`productcategorieën <pos/products/categories>` op die "
