#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/preparation.rst:36
msgid "Optionally, assign colors to stages for better visibility."
msgstr "Wijs optioneel kleuren toe aan fases voor betere zichtbaarheid."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/preparation.rst:37
msgid ""
"Set an :guilabel:`Alert timer (min)` for each stage to define the expected "
