"<pos/use/create-pos>` en biedt snelle toegang tot "
"het :guilabel:`Voorbereidingsscherm` overzicht vanuit het hoofddashboard."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/preparation.rst:80
msgid ""
"If at least one :doc:`restaurant point of sale <../restaurant>` is "
