":doc:`Preset <presets>`, zoals :guilabel:`Hier eten` "
"of :guilabel:`levering`, indien van toepassing"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/preparation.rst:126
msgid ""
":ref:`POS categories <pos/products/categories>` defined on the :ref:`display "
