"or :guilabel:`Drinks`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Kassacategorieën <pos/products/categories>` gedefinieerd op "
"het :ref:`weergaveformulier <pos/preparation/configuration>`, "
"zoals :guilabel:`Eten` of :guilabel:`Drinken`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/preparation.rst:129
msgid ""
"The total number of orders/category items is displayed next to the "
