#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:-1
msgid ""
"This page explains how to apply discounts, discount codes, promotions, and "
"loyalty programs in Point of Sale, along with configuring pricelists, cash "
"rounding, and fiscal positions for flexible tax handling."
msgstr ""
"Deze pagina legt uit hoe je kortingen, kortingscodes, promoties en "
"loyaliteitsprogramma's toepast in Kassa, samen met het configureren van "
"prijslijsten, contante afronding en fiscale posities voor flexibele btw-"
"verwerking."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:13
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/discounts.rst:3
msgid "Discounts"
msgstr "Kortingen"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:15
msgid ""
"Discounts allow users to reduce the price of item lines in POS orders. The "
"discount can be applied as a percentage of a product's sale price or the "
"total order amount."
msgstr ""
"Kortingen stellen gebruikers in staat om de prijs van artikelregels in Kassa-"
"bestellingen te verlagen. De korting kan worden toegepast als percentage van "
"de verkoopprijs van een product of het totale orderbedrag."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:18
msgid ""
"To activate discounts, navigate to the :ref:`POS settings <pos/use/"
"settings>`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`Pricing` section, and enable:"
msgstr ""
"Navigeer naar de :ref:`kassainstellingen <pos/use/settings>`, scroll naar "
"het gedeelte :guilabel:`Prijsstelling` en schakel het volgende in om "
"kortingen te activeren:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:21
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Global Discounts` to allow users to set a discount on the entire "
"order. Modify the default discount percentage in the :guilabel:`Discount %` "
"field if needed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Algemene kortingen` om gebruikers toe te staan een korting op de "
"hele bestelling in te stellen. Pas het standaard kortingspercentage in het "
"veld :guilabel:`Korting %` aan indien nodig."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:23
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Line Discounts` to allow users to set discounts on specific "
"products in the cart."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Regelkortingen` om gebruikers toe te staan kortingen op "
"specifieke producten in het winkelmandje in te stellen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:26
msgid ":doc:`../../sales/products_prices/prices/discounts`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../sales/products_prices/prices/discounts`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:29
msgid "Global discounts"
msgstr "Algemene kortingen"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:31
msgid ""
"To apply a discount on the whole order from the :ref:`POS register <pos/use/"
"open-register>`, click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`vertical "
"ellipsis`) icon, then :icon:`fa-tag` :guilabel:`Discount`. Set the discount "
"percentage and click :guilabel:`Confirm`."
msgstr ""
"Klik op het :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`verticale ellips`) icoon en "
"vervolgens op :icon:`fa-tag` :guilabel:`Korting` om een korting op de hele "
"bestelling toe te passen vanaf de :ref:`kassaregistratie <pos/use/open-"
"register>`. Stel het kortingspercentage in en klik op :guilabel:`Bevestigen`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:36
msgid "Line discounts"
msgstr "Regelkortingen"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:38
msgid ""
"To set a discount on a specific product, select the product from the cart, "
"click the :guilabel:`%` cart modifier from the pad, then use the numpad to "
"set the discount."
msgstr ""
"Selecteer het product uit het winkelmandje, klik op de :guilabel:`%` "
"winkelmandje-modifier vanuit het toetsenbord en gebruik vervolgens het "
"cijfertoetsenbord om de korting in te stellen om een korting op een "
"specifiek product in te stellen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:42
msgid ""
"Adding other products to the cart switches the cart modifier back "
"to :guilabel:`Qty` automatically."
msgstr ""
"Het toevoegen van andere producten aan het winkelmandje schakelt de "
"winkelmandje-modifier automatisch terug naar :guilabel:`Aantal`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:44
msgid ""
"To remove a discount, select the product from the cart, click :guilabel:`%`, "
"then click :guilabel:`⌫`"
msgstr ""
"Selecteer het product uit het winkelmandje, klik op :guilabel:`%` en klik "
"vervolgens op :guilabel:`⌫` om een korting te verwijderen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:50
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:8
msgid "Discount and loyalty programs"
msgstr "Kortings- en loyaliteitsprogramma's"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:52
msgid ""
"Discount and loyalty programs provide flexible, customer-facing pricing "
"strategies. Unlike :doc:`pricelists <../../sales/products_prices/prices/"
"pricing>`, which define structured pricing rules, discount and loyalty "
"programs are designed for promotional, time-sensitive, and public offers, "
"such as seasonal sales, limited-time deals, or customer rewards."
msgstr ""
"Kortings- en loyaliteitsprogramma's bieden flexibele, klantgerichte "
"prijsstrategieën. In tegenstelling tot :doc:`prijslijsten <../../sales/"
"products_prices/prices/pricing>`, die gestructureerde prijsregels "
"definiëren, zijn kortings- en loyaliteitsprogramma's ontworpen voor "
"promotionele, tijdgevoelige en openbare aanbiedingen, zoals "
"seizoensuitverkoop, tijdelijke aanbiedingen of klantbeloningen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:57
msgid ""
"To activate discount and loyalty programs in Point of Sale, navigate to "
"the :ref:`POS settings <pos/use/settings>`, scroll down to "
"the :guilabel:`Pricing` section, and enable :guilabel:`Promotions, Coupons, "
"Gift Card & Loyalty Program`."
msgstr ""
"Navigeer naar de :ref:`kassainstellingen <pos/use/settings>`, scroll naar "
"het gedeelte :guilabel:`Prijsstelling` en schakel :guilabel:`Promoties, "
"kortingsbonnen, cadeaubon & loyaliteitsprogramma` in om kortings- en "
"loyaliteitsprogramma's in Kassa te activeren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:61
msgid ""
"Once the feature has been activated, go to :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> "
"Products --> Discount & Loyalty` and :ref:`configure the desired discount "
"and loyalty programs <sales/loyalty_discount/configure-programs>`. These "
"programs are triggered when an order meets the defined requirements. "
"Depending on the :ref:`program type <sales/loyalty_discount/program-types>`, "
"rewards are either applied automatically or manually by the cashier."
msgstr ""
"Ga, zodra de functie is geactiveerd, naar :menuselection:`Kassa --> "
"Producten --> Korting & loyaliteit` en :ref:`configureer de gewenste "
"kortings- en loyaliteitsprogramma's <sales/loyalty_discount/configure-"
"programs>`. Deze programma's worden geactiveerd wanneer een bestelling aan "
"de ingestelde voorwaarden voldoet. Afhankelijk van het :ref:`programmatype "
"<sales/loyalty_discount/program-types>` worden beloningen automatisch of "
"handmatig door de caissière toegepast."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:68
msgid ":doc:`../../sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:73
msgid "Codes"
msgstr "Codes"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:75
msgid ""
"To apply a discount code or a coupon, click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` "
"(:guilabel:`vertical ellipsis`) icon, select :icon:`fa-"
"barcode` :guilabel:`Enter Code`, enter or scan the code, and "
"click :guilabel:`Apply`."
msgstr ""
"Klik, om een kortingscode of waardebon toe te passen, op het "
"pictogram :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`drie verticale puntjes`), "
"selecteer :icon:`fa-barcode` :guilabel:`Voer code in`, voer de code in of "
"scan deze en klik op :guilabel:`Toepassen`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:80
msgid ""
"Coupon and next-order coupon codes are printed directly on customer receipts."
msgstr ""
"Kortingsbon- en volgende-bestelling-kortingsboncodes worden direct op "
"klantontvangstbewijzen afgedrukt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:83
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:56
msgid "Promotions"
msgstr "Promoties"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:85
msgid ""
"Promotions are fully automated. They are applied to the order as soon as all "
"program conditions (such as minimum spent or specific products) are met."
msgstr ""
"Promoties zijn volledig geautomatiseerd. Ze worden op de bestelling "
"toegepast zodra aan alle programmavoorwaarden (zoals minimaal besteed of "
"specifieke producten) is voldaan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:89
msgid "Buy X get Y"
msgstr "Koop X ontvang Y"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:91
msgid ""
"When the order qualifies for a **Buy X get Y** deal, the reward must be "
"added manually. Click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`vertical "
"ellipsis`) icon, select :icon:`fa-star` :guilabel:`Reward`, and choose the "
"desired item from the list."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer de bestelling in aanmerking komt voor een **Koop X en ontvang Y**-"
"aanbieding, moet de beloning handmatig worden toegevoegd. Klik op "
"het :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`verticale ellips`) icoon, "
"selecteer :icon:`fa-star` :guilabel:`Beloning` en kies het gewenste artikel "
"uit de lijst."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:96
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:31
msgid "Loyalty cards"
msgstr "Klantenkaarten"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:98
msgid ""
"To track or spend loyalty points, you must first :ref:`select a customer "
"<pos/use/customers>` in the POS register. Once selected, "
"their :guilabel:`Loyalty point(s)` are displayed at the bottom of the cart "
"and updated in real-time."
msgstr ""
"Om loyaliteitspunten bij te houden of te besteden, moet je eerst :ref:`een "
"klant selecteren <pos/use/customers>` in de kassa. Eenmaal geselecteerd, "
"worden hun :guilabel:`Loyaliteitspunt(en)` onderaan het winkelmandje "
"weergegeven en in realtime bijgewerkt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:102
msgid ""
"To redeem points for a reward, click the :icon:`oi-ellipsis-v` "
"(:guilabel:`vertical ellipsis`) icon, select :icon:`fa-"
"star` :guilabel:`Reward`, and choose the desired item from the list."
msgstr ""
"Om punten in te wisselen voor een beloning, klik je op het :icon:`oi-"
"ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`verticale ellips`) icoon, selecteer je :icon:`fa-"
"star` :guilabel:`Beloning` en kies je het gewenste artikel uit de lijst."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:108
msgid "Gift cards and eWallets"
msgstr "Cadeaubonnen en eWallets"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:110
msgid ""
"Gift cards and eWallets are used by customers to pay for orders using a "
"prepaid balance. Gift cards can be purchased, while eWallets hold store "
"credit linked to the customer's account."
msgstr ""
"Cadeaubonnen en eWallets worden door klanten gebruikt om bestellingen te "
"betalen met een vooraf betaald saldo. Cadeaubonnen kunnen worden "
"aangeschaft, terwijl eWallets winkeltegoed bevatten dat is gekoppeld aan het "
"account van de klant."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:113
msgid ""
"To activate gift cards and eWallets in Point of Sale, navigate to "
"the :ref:`POS settings <pos/use/settings>`, scroll down to "
"the :guilabel:`Pricing` section, enable the :guilabel:`Promotions, Coupons, "
"Gift Card & Loyalty Program` setting, and click :guilabel:`Save`. Once "
"activated, click :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Gift cards & eWallet` "
"under the same setting to configure the desired :ref:`gift card "
"<ewallet_gift/gift-cards>` and :ref:`eWallet <sales/ewallets_giftcards/"
"ewallets>` programs and generate gift cards and eWallets."
msgstr ""
"Navigeer, om cadeaubonnen en eWallets in Kassa te activeren, naar "
"de :ref:`kassa-instellingen <pos/use/settings>`, scrol omlaag naar het "
"gedeelte :guilabel:`Prijzen`, schakel de instelling :guilabel:`Promoties, "
"coupons, cadeaubon- & loyaliteitsprogramma` in en klik "
"op :guilabel:`Opslaan`. Klik na activering op :icon:`oi-arrow-"
"right` :guilabel:`Cadeaubonnen & eWallet` onder dezelfde instelling om de "
"gewenste :ref:`cadeaubon- <ewallet_gift/gift-cards>` en :ref:`eWallet- "
"<sales/ewallets_giftcards/ewallets>`programma's te configureren en "
"cadeaubonnen en eWallets te genereren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:121
msgid ""
"Alternatively, to configure and edit gift cards and eWallets, go "
"to :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Products --> Gift cards & eWallet`."
msgstr ""
"Ga als alternatief, om cadeaubonnen en eWallets te configureren en te "
"bewerken, naar :menuselection:`Kassa --> Producten --> Cadeaubonnen & "
"eWallet`."

