msgstr ""
"Klik op :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Gratis metalen / houten "
"standaards` om `QR-codestandaards bij Odoo te bestellen <https://"
"www.odoo.com/app/point-of-sale-restaurant-qr-code>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:36
msgid ""
"In :ref:`restaurants <pos/restaurant/floors>`, printing or downloading QR "
"codes generates as many QR codes as the number of available tables. In "
"**shops**, it generates only one generic QR code."
msgstr ""
"In :ref:`restaurants <pos/restaurant/floors>` genereert het afdrukken of "
"downloaden van QR-codes evenveel QR-codes als het aantal beschikbare tafels. "
"In **winkels** genereert het slechts één generieke QR-code."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:40
msgid ""
"To customize QR codes, scan the relevant QR code to acquire its URL, then "
"use a QR code generator (e.g., `QR code monkey <https://www.qrcode-"
"monkey.com>`_, `QR code generator <https://www.qr-code-generator.com>`_, or "
"`JustMakeTheQRCode.com <https://justmaketheqrcode.com/>`_) to create a "
"custom QR code."
msgstr ""
"Scan om QR-codes aan te passen de betreffende QR-code om de URL te "
"verkrijgen en gebruik vervolgens een QR-codegenerator (bijv. `QR code monkey "
"<https://www.qrcode-monkey.com>`_, `QR code generator <https://www.qr-code-"
"generator.com>`_ of `JustMakeTheQRCode.com <https://justmaketheqrcode.com/"
">`_) om een aangepaste QR-code te maken."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:47
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`Kiosk` to let customers browse the menu or product "
"catalog, place orders, and pay directly at a self-ordering kiosk."
msgstr ""
"Selecteer :guilabel:`Kiosk` om klanten het menu of de productcatalogus te "
