"betalen aan een zelfbestelkiosk."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:50
msgid ""
"Once a self-ordering type is selected, click :icon:`fa-arrow-"
"right` :guilabel:`Preview Web interface` under the :guilabel:`Self Ordering` "
"field to ensure all :ref:`additional settings <pos/self_order/additional-"
