msgstr "Starten op IoT Box"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:140
msgid ""
"This option allows for using an :doc:`IoT Box </applications/general/iot/"
"iot_box>` connected to a touchscreen as a self-ordering kiosk."
msgstr ""
"Met deze optie kun je een :doc:`IoT Box </applications/general/iot/iot_box>` "
"gebruiken die is aangesloten op een touchscreen als zelfbedieningskiosk."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:143
msgid ""
":doc:`Connect an IoT Box </applications/general/iot/connect>` to your Odoo "
"database."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Verbind een IoT Box </applications/general/iot/connect>` met je Odoo-"
"database."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:144
msgid ""
"Ensure a touchscreen :doc:`display </applications/general/iot/devices/"
"screen>` is connected."
msgstr ""
"Zorg dat er een touchscreen-:doc:`scherm </applications/general/iot/devices/"
"screen>` is aangesloten."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:146
msgid "Select the IoT Box from the :guilabel:`Launch on` field."
msgstr "Selecteer de IoT Box in het veld :guilabel:`Starten op`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:149
msgid ""
"Once connected to the IoT box, the touchscreen display appears as two "
"separate devices in the IoT box's list of devices: a display and a keyboard "
"input device."
msgstr ""
"Zodra verbonden met de IoT Box, verschijnt het touchscreen als twee "
