"ondersteunt Odoo :doc:`Cashdro <cash_machines/cashdro>`-, :doc:`Cashmatic "
"<cash_machines/cashmatic>`- en :doc:`Glory <cash_machines/glory>`-"
"geldautomaten. Zodra de geldautomaat volledig is ingesteld:"

