"docs/common-api/asynchronous-notification/>`_ from QFPay."
msgstr ""
"Vraag de activering van `Asynchrone notificaties <https://sdk.qfapi.com/docs/"
"common-api/asynchronous-notification/>`_ aan bij QFPay."

