msgid "Order printing"
msgstr "Bestellingen afdrukken"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:403
msgid ""
"To enable sending orders to a kitchen or a bar printer, :doc:`connect a "
"printer <hardware_network/receipt_printers>` to Odoo, go to the :ref:`POS "
"settings <pos/use/settings>`, and follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Verbind een printer <hardware_network/receipt_printers>` met Odoo, ga "
"naar de :ref:`kassainstellingen <pos/use/settings>` en volg deze stappen om "
"bestellingen naar een keuken- of barprinter te versturen:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:407
msgid ""
"Scroll down to the :guilabel:`Preparation` section and enable "
"the :guilabel:`Preparation Printers` setting."
msgstr ""
"Scroll naar beneden naar de sectie :guilabel:`Voorbereiding` en schakel de "
"instelling :guilabel:`Voorbereidingsprinters` in."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:409
