"Type the printer's name in the :guilabel:`Printers` field and "
"click :guilabel:`Create and edit`."
msgstr ""
"Typ de naam van de printer in het veld :guilabel:`Printers` en klik "
"op :guilabel:`Aanmaken en bewerken`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:410
msgid "Set the :guilabel:`Type` field to :guilabel:`Preparation`."
msgstr "Stel het veld :guilabel:`Type` in op :guilabel:`Bereiding`."

