msgstr ""
"Klik, om de configuratie van de printer te testen in het "
"formulier :guilabel:`Bereidingsprinters aanmaken`, op :guilabel:`Testen`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:433
msgid ""
"To access all created printers from the :ref:`POS settings <pos/use/"
