#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:519
msgid "Tips"
msgstr "Tips"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:524
msgid ""
"To allow tipping in a POS, go to the :ref:`POS settings <pos/use/settings>`, "
"scroll down to the :guilabel:`Payment` section, enable :guilabel:`Tips`, and "
"click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Om fooi toe te staan in een kassa, ga je naar de :ref:`kassainstellingen "
"<pos/use/settings>`, scrol je naar de sectie :guilabel:`Betaling`, schakel "
"je :guilabel:`Fooien` in en klik je op :guilabel:`Opslaan`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:528
msgid ""
"Depending on your hardware setup and geographical location, enable the "
"following options as relevant:"
msgstr ""
"Schakel afhankelijk van je hardware-instellingen en geografische locatie de "
"volgende opties in waar relevant:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:531
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Add tip through payment terminal (Adyen)`: Only works with "
"an :doc:`Adyen <payment_methods/terminals/adyen>` card terminal."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Fooi toevoegen via betaalterminal (Adyen)`: werkt alleen met "
"een :doc:`Adyen <payment_methods/terminals/adyen>`-betaalterminal."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:533
msgid ""
":ref:`Add tip after payment <pos/restaurant/tips-after-payment>`: Only works "
"for a POS in the United States of America with an :doc:`Adyen "
"<payment_methods/terminals/adyen>` or a :doc:`Stripe <payment_methods/"
"terminals/stripe>` :ref:`payment terminal <pos/terminals/configuration>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Fooi toevoegen na betaling <pos/restaurant/tips-after-payment>`: werkt "
"alleen voor een kassa in de Verenigde Staten met een :doc:`Adyen "
"<payment_methods/terminals/adyen>`- of een :doc:`Stripe <payment_methods/"
"terminals/stripe>` :ref:`betaalterminal <pos/terminals/configuration>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:539
msgid ""
"Saving the :guilabel:`Tips` setting automatically fills the :guilabel:`Tip "
"product` field with the preconfigured :guilabel:`[TIPS] Tips` product, which "
"is only used for tips. When selecting another product in the :guilabel:`Tip "
"product` field, the chosen product is no longer available on the :ref:`POS "
"register <pos/restaurant/orders>`."
msgstr ""
"Door de instelling :guilabel:`Fooien` op te slaan, wordt het "
"veld :guilabel:`Fooiproduct` automatisch ingevuld met het vooraf "
"geconfigureerde product :guilabel:`[TIPS] Tips`, dat alleen voor fooien "
"wordt gebruikt. Wanneer je een ander product selecteert in het "
"veld :guilabel:`Fooiproduct`, is het gekozen product niet meer beschikbaar "
"op het :ref:`kassasysteem <pos/restaurant/orders>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:547
msgid "Tip and payment"
msgstr "Fooi en betaling"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:549
msgid ""
"To process a tip during :ref:`payment <pos/restaurant/bills/payment>`, "
"follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"Volg deze stappen om een fooi te verwerken tijdens :ref:`betaling <pos/"
"restaurant/bills/payment>`:"

