#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use/pos_invoices.rst:18
msgid "Invoice creation"
msgstr "Factuur aanmaken"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use/pos_invoices.rst:20
msgid ""
"Invoices can be created :ref:`during the ordering process <pos/invoices/"
"generate-payment>`, :ref:`after the ordering process <pos/invoices/generate-"
"overview>`, or :ref:`by consolidating multiple sales orders from the same "
"customer <pos/invoices/generate-global>`."
msgstr ""
"Facturen kunnen worden aangemaakt :ref:`tijdens het bestelproces <pos/"
"invoices/generate-payment>`, :ref:`na het bestelproces <pos/invoices/"
"generate-overview>`, of :ref:`door meerdere verkooporders van dezelfde klant "
"samen te voegen <pos/invoices/generate-global>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use/pos_invoices.rst:25
msgid ""
"Creating an invoice requires :ref:`assigning the customer to the order <pos/"
"use/customers>`. To ensure the customer is identified on the invoice, "
"click :guilabel:`Customer` in the :ref:`POS register <pos/use/open-"
"register>`, then select or create one."
msgstr ""
"Voor het aanmaken van een factuur is het nodig om :ref:`de klant aan de "
"bestelling toe te wijzen <pos/use/customers>`. Klik om ervoor te zorgen dat "
"de klant op de factuur wordt geïdentificeerd op :guilabel:`Klant` in "
"het :ref:`kassasysteem <pos/use/open-register>` en selecteer of maak er een "
"aan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use/pos_invoices.rst:30
msgid ""
"An invoice created in a POS creates an entry into the "
"corresponding :ref:`accounting journal <cheat_sheet/journals>` configured in "
"the :ref:`POS settings <pos/use/settings>`. To modify the default journals "
"for orders and invoices, go to :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`Accounting` "
"section, and select the appropriate journals in the :guilabel:`Orders` "
"and :guilabel:`Invoices` fields under :guilabel:`Default Journals`."
msgstr ""
"Een factuur die is aangemaakt in een Kassa creëert een boeking in het "
"overeenkomstige :ref:`dagboek <cheat_sheet/journals>` dat is geconfigureerd "
"in de :ref:`Kassa-instellingen <pos/use/settings>`. Ga om de standaard "
"dagboeken voor bestellingen en facturen te wijzigen "
"naar :menuselection:`Kassa --> Configuratie --> Instellingen`, scroll naar "
"beneden naar het gedeelte :guilabel:`Boekhouding` en selecteer de juiste "
"dagboeken in de velden :guilabel:`Bestellingen` en :guilabel:`Facturen` "
"onder :guilabel:`Standaard dagboeken`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use/pos_invoices.rst:36
msgid ""
"Specific journals can also be defined for each :doc:`payment method <../"
"payment_methods>`."
msgstr ""
"Er kunnen ook specifieke dagboeken worden gedefinieerd voor "
"elke :doc:`betaalmethode <../payment_methods>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use/pos_invoices.rst:39
msgid "From the frontend"
msgstr "Vanaf de frontend"

