#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:160
msgid ""
"Creating a :ref:`new pricelist <sales/products/create-edit-pricelists>` "
"allows for better customization when applying rental rates to specific time "
"periods, products, or customers by using :guilabel:`Pricelist Rules`. It is "
