#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:-1
msgid ""
"This page describes the *Rental Orders* dashboard, the landing page of the "
"**Rental** app, covering its available views and the status, invoice, and "
"search bar filters used to organize rental orders."
msgstr ""
"Deze pagina beschrijft het dashboard *Verhuurorders*, de startpagina van de "
"app **Verhuur**, inclusief de beschikbare weergaven en de status-, factuur- "
"en zoekbalkfilters die worden gebruikt om verhuurorders te organiseren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:8
msgid "Rental Orders dashboard"
msgstr "Dashboard verhuurorders"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:10
msgid ""
"The *Rental Orders* dashboard serves as the landing page for the **Rental** "
"app. It provides a high-level view of all rental orders, with smart buttons "
"to navigate to filtered lists of rentals. This "
"includes :guilabel:`Pickups`, :guilabel:`Returns`, :guilabel:`Late` returns, "
"rentals :guilabel:`To Confirm`, :guilabel:`To Invoice`, and any action items "
"for :guilabel:`Today`."
msgstr ""
"Het dashboard *Verhuurorders* dient als startpagina voor de **Verhuur**-app. "
"Het biedt een overzicht op hoog niveau van alle verhuurorders, met slimme "
"knoppen om naar gefilterde lijsten met verhuren te navigeren. Dit "
"omvat :guilabel:`Ophalen`, :guilabel:`Retourneren`, :guilabel:`Te laat` "
"geretourneerd, verhuren :guilabel:`Te bevestigen`, :guilabel:`Te factureren` "
"en actiepunten voor :guilabel:`Vandaag`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:15
msgid ""
"To view the *Rental Orders* dashboard, open the **Rental** app or go "
"to :menuselection:`Rental app --> Orders --> Orders`, and the dashboard "
"loads in the default :icon:`fa-list` :guilabel:`(List)` view. Other "
"available views are: :icon:`oi-view-kanban` :guilabel:`(Kanban)`, :icon:`fa-"
"calendar` :guilabel:`(Calendar)`, :icon:`oi-view-"
"pivot` :guilabel:`(Pivot)`, :icon:`fa-area-chart` :guilabel:`(Graph)`, "
"and :icon:`fa-clock-o` :guilabel:`(Activity)`."
msgstr ""
"Open om het dashboard *Verhuurorders* te bekijken de **Verhuur**-app of ga "
"naar :menuselection:`Verhuur app --> Orders --> Orders`; het dashboard wordt "
"geladen in de standaardweergave :icon:`fa-list` :guilabel:`(Lijst)`. Andere "
"beschikbare weergaven zijn: :icon:`oi-view-"
"kanban` :guilabel:`(Kanban)`, :icon:`fa-"
"calendar` :guilabel:`(Kalender)`, :icon:`oi-view-"
"pivot` :guilabel:`(Draaitabel)`, :icon:`fa-area-chart` :guilabel:`(Grafiek)` "
"en :icon:`fa-clock-o` :guilabel:`(Activiteit)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:21
msgid "Example of the Rental Orders Dashboard in the Rental app."
msgstr "Voorbeeld van het dashboard Verhuurorders in de Verhuur-app."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:24
msgid "At the top of the dashboard, there are six smart buttons:"
msgstr "Bovenaan het dashboard bevinden zich zes slimme knoppen:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:26
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Today`: Filters the dashboard to show rental orders "
"whose :guilabel:`Pick up Date` or :guilabel:`Return Date` is the present "
"date. These are rental orders with the status of :guilabel:`Reserved` "
"or :guilabel:`Pickedup`. It also includes orders with late pickup or return "
"dates. This filter is the default filter for the *Rental Orders* dashboard."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Vandaag`: Filtert het dashboard om verhuurorders te tonen waarvan "
"de :guilabel:`Ophaaldatum` of :guilabel:`Retourdatum` de huidige datum is. "
"Dit zijn verhuurorders met de status :guilabel:`Gereserveerd` "
"of :guilabel:`Opgehaald`. Dit omvat ook orders met te late ophaal- of "
"retourdata. Dit filter is het standaardfilter voor het dashboard "
"*Verhuurorders*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:30
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Pickups`: Filters the dashboard to show only rental orders with "
"the :guilabel:`Reserved` status that are waiting to be picked up by the "
"customer."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Ophalen`: Filtert het dashboard om alleen verhuurorders te tonen "
"met de status :guilabel:`Gereserveerd` die wachten om door de klant te "
"worden opgehaald."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:32
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Returns`: Filters the dashboard to show only rental orders with "
"the :guilabel:`Pickedup` status that have not been returned yet. This "
"includes both on-time and past-due returns."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Retourneren`: Filtert het dashboard om alleen verhuurorders te "
"tonen met de status :guilabel:`Opgehaald` die nog niet zijn geretourneerd. "
"Dit omvat zowel tijdige als te late retouren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:35
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Late`: Filters the dashboard to show only rental orders "
"whose :guilabel:`Pick up Date` or :guilabel:`Return Date` is overdue."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Te laat`: Filtert het dashboard om alleen verhuurorders te tonen "
"waarvan de :guilabel:`Ophaaldatum` of :guilabel:`Retourdatum` is verstreken."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:37
msgid ""
":guilabel:`To Confirm`: Filters the dashboard to show only unconfirmed "
"rental quotations."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Te bevestigen`: Filtert het dashboard om alleen onbevestigde "
"verhuuroffertes te tonen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:38
msgid ""
":guilabel:`To Invoice`: Filters the dashboard to show all rental orders "
"without an invoice created. This includes both :guilabel:`Reserved` "
"and :guilabel:`Pickedup` rentals."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Te factureren`: Filtert het dashboard om alle verhuurorders te "
"tonen waarvoor geen factuur is aangemaakt. Dit omvat "
"zowel :guilabel:`Gereserveerd` als :guilabel:`Opgehaald` verhuren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:41
msgid ""
"Every smart button displays the number of rental orders or quotations within "
"its category. Click the smart button to apply the filter to the search bar. "
"Click it again to remove the filter. Multiple smart buttons can be applied "
"at the same time, further filtering the results."
msgstr ""
"Elke slimme knop toont het aantal verhuurorders of -offertes binnen de "
"categorie. Klik op de slimme knop om het filter toe te passen op de "
"zoekbalk. Klik er nogmaals op om het filter te verwijderen. Je kunt meerdere "
"slimme knoppen tegelijk toepassen om de resultaten verder te filteren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:45
msgid "The :icon:`fa-list` :guilabel:`(List)` view has the following columns:"
msgstr ""
"De weergave :icon:`fa-list` :guilabel:`(Lijst)` heeft de volgende kolommen:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:47
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Order Reference`: The unique number Odoo gives to rental quotes "
"and orders."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Orderreferentie`: Het unieke nummer dat Odoo toekent aan "
"verhuuroffertes en -orders."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:48
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Customer`: The name of the customer who requested the rental "
"quote or order."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Klant`: De naam van de klant die de verhuurofferte of -order "
"heeft aangevraagd."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:49
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Status`: Displays the progression of the rental order using one "
"of the following options:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Status`: Geeft de voortgang van de verhuurorder weer via een van "
"de volgende opties:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:52
msgid ":guilabel:`Quotation`: The rental quotation is not confirmed."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Offerte`: De verhuurofferte is niet bevestigd."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:53
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Reserved`: The rental order is confirmed, and the rental products "
"have been scheduled for pickup."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Gereserveerd`: De verhuurorder is bevestigd en de verhuurde "
"producten zijn ingepland om te worden opgehaald."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:55
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Pickedup`: The rental order is confirmed, and the rental products "
"have been picked up."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Opgehaald`: De verhuurorder is bevestigd en de verhuurde "
"producten zijn opgehaald."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:57
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Returned`: The rental order is confirmed, and the rental products "
"have been picked up and returned."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Geretourneerd`: De verhuurorder is bevestigd en de verhuurde "
"producten zijn opgehaald en geretourneerd."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:59
msgid ":guilabel:`Cancelled`: The rental quote or order is terminated."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Geannuleerd`: De verhuurofferte of -order is beëindigd."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:61
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Pick up Date`: The scheduled date on the rental order for the "
"rental product to be picked up."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Ophaaldatum`: De geplande datum op de verhuurorder waarop het "
"verhuurproduct moet worden opgehaald."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:63
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Return Date`: The scheduled date on the rental order for the "
"rental product to be returned."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Retourdatum`: De geplande datum op de verhuurorder waarop het "
"verhuurproduct moet worden geretourneerd."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:65
msgid ":guilabel:`Total`: The rental quote or order's total amount with tax."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Totaal`: Het totale bedrag van de verhuurofferte of -order "
"inclusief btw."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:66
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Invoice Status`: Displays the invoice stage using one of the "
"following options:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Factuurstatus`: Geeft de factuurfase weer aan de hand van een van "
"de volgende opties:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:68
msgid ":guilabel:`To invoice`: The rental order has no associated invoice."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Te factureren`: De verhuurorder heeft geen gekoppelde factuur."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:69
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Fully invoiced`: The rental order has either a drafted or posted "
"invoice. However, the filter doesn't include invoice payment status."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Volledig gefactureerd`: De verhuurorder heeft een factuur in "
"concept of een geboekte factuur. Het filter bevat echter niet de "
"betalingsstatus van de factuur."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:71
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Nothing to invoice`: The rental quote has not been confirmed yet, "
"and thus the invoice amount is not finalized."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Niets te factureren`: De verhuurofferte is nog niet bevestigd, "
"waardoor het factuurbedrag nog niet definitief is."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:74
msgid ""
"The following columns can be enabled using the :icon:`fa-"
"sliders` :guilabel:`(adjust settings)` "
"icon: :guilabel:`Salesperson`, :guilabel:`Order Date`, :guilabel:`Sales "
"Team`, :guilabel:`Tags`, and :guilabel:`Activities`."
msgstr ""
"De volgende kolommen kunnen worden ingeschakeld met behulp van het "
"pictogram :icon:`fa-sliders` :guilabel:`(instellingen "
"aanpassen)`: :guilabel:`Verkoper`, :guilabel:`Orderdatum`, :guilabel:`Verkoopteam`, :guilabel:`Labels` "
"en :guilabel:`Activiteiten`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:78
msgid ""
"Rental orders that are late for their specified :guilabel:`Pick up Date` "
"or :guilabel:`Return Date` columns display in red text. Rental orders "
"without an invoice display in blue text in the :guilabel:`Total` column. At "
"the bottom of the :guilabel:`Total` column, the total amount of all the "
"rental quotations and orders together is shown."
msgstr ""
"Verhuurorders die te laat zijn volgens de opgegeven "
"kolommen :guilabel:`Ophaaldatum` of :guilabel:`Retourdatum` worden in rode "
"tekst weergegeven. Verhuurorders zonder factuur worden in blauwe tekst "
"weergegeven in de kolom :guilabel:`Totaal`. Onderaan de "
"kolom :guilabel:`Totaal` wordt het totale bedrag van alle verhuuroffertes en "
"-orders samen weergegeven."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:83
msgid ""
"Another way to filter the dashboard is to use the search bar filters. Click "
"the search bar to view the preconfigured filters."
msgstr ""
"Een andere manier om het dashboard te filteren is met behulp van de "
"zoekbalkfilters. Klik op de zoekbalk om de vooraf geconfigureerde filters te "
"bekijken."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:89
msgid "Refine the results using the following :guilabel:`Filters`:"
msgstr "Verfijn de resultaten met de volgende :guilabel:`Filters`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:91
msgid ""
":guilabel:`My Orders`: Only shows rental quotations and orders created by "
"the user."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Mijn orders`: toont alleen verhuuroffertes en orders die door de "
"gebruiker zijn aangemaakt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:92
msgid ":guilabel:`Rentals` (default): Only shows rental orders."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Verhuur` (standaard): Toont alleen verhuurorders."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:95
msgid ""
"When this filter is removed from the search bar, the dashboard lists sales "
"orders. Therefore, always keep the *Rentals* filter as the default one."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer dit filter uit de zoekbalk wordt verwijderd, toont het dashboard "
"verkooporders. Houd daarom het filter *Verhuur* altijd als standaardfilter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:98
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Today`: Shows rental orders that have the current date as the "
"*Pickup* or *Return* date. It also includes orders with late pickup or "
"return dates."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Vandaag`: Geeft verhuurorders weer met de huidige datum als "
"*Ophaal-* of *Retourdatum*. Dit omvat ook orders met een te late ophaal- of "
"retourdatum."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:100
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Late`: Shows rental orders with the *Pickedup* status and a past "
"*Return* date."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Te laat`: Toont verhuurorders met de status *Opgehaald* en een "
"verstreken *Retourdatum*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:101
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Pickup Date`: Shows rental orders that have the *Reserved* status."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Ophaaldatum`: Toont verhuurorders met de status *Gereserveerd*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:102
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Return Date`: Shows rental orders that have the *Pickedup* status."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Retourdatum`: Toont verhuurorders met de status *Opgehaald*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:107
msgid ""
"Group orders using any of the following options in the :guilabel:`Group By` "
"menu:"
msgstr ""
"Groepeer orders met behulp van een van de volgende opties in het "
"menu :guilabel:`Groeperen op`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:109
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Status`: Creates and sorts rental quotations and orders by three "
"different stages: *Quotation*, *Reserved*, and *Pickedup*."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Status`: Sorteert en verdeelt verhuuroffertes en -orders over "
"drie verschillende fasen: *Offerte*, *Gereserveerd* en *Opgehaald*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:111
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Salesperson`: Creates and sorts rental quotations and orders by "
"the user who created them."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Verkoper`: Sorteert en groepeert verhuuroffertes en -orders op "
"basis van de gebruiker die ze heeft aangemaakt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:113
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Customer`: Creates and sorts rental quotations and orders by the "
"listed customer on the rental quotation and order."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Klant`: Sorteert en groepeert verhuuroffertes en -orders op basis "
"van de vermelde klant op de verhuurofferte en -order."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:115
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Custom Group`: Creates and sorts rental quotations and orders by "
"customized groups created in Odoo."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Aangepaste groep`: Sorteert en groepeert verhuuroffertes en "
"-orders op basis van aangepaste groepen die in Odoo zijn gemaakt."

